@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我也姑且没事。<br>这个先不提，这里到底是什么地方？|#0101Bad05_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR6,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:唔……|#0101Bad05_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:我猜这里应该是座枯井吧。|#0101Bad05_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:说着，雪莉抬头往上看。<br>于是艾玛和汉娜也抬头看。<br>能看到外面的天空在很高的地方，这里离外界十分地远。|#0101Bad05_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR6,ArmL16
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR6,ArmL4
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:掉到这么深的地方，<br>真亏我们还能没事……|#0101Bad05_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想应该是垫子起作用了吧。<br>这里的土壤很柔软，也积了很多的叶子。|#0101Bad05_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:原来如此……不对，现在不是讨论这个的时候啦！<br>我们要怎么出去啊！？|#0101Bad05_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR17,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:那只能爬墙上去了啊。|#0101Bad05_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来也只能这样了。|#0101Bad05_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛把手放在爬满青苔的墙上。|#0101Bad05_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR5,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，这真的能爬到顶吗……|#0101Bad05_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的声音里没什么自信。<br>刚刚艾玛也是想着爬上围墙，没过多久就用尽力气了。|#0101Bad05_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这样的话，就试试靠我的魔法<br>逃出这里哇啊啊啊……！|#0101Bad05_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Hanna Loop:false ScenePositionX:55|50|45 ScenePositionY:65|70|75

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜稍微飘起来了一点点。|#0101Bad05_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Hanna Loop:false ScenePositionX:50 ScenePositionY:50

[PrintTextModified Text:她摇摇晃晃地试着抬升高度，<br>但没一会就落地了。|#0101Bad05_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:该死的！太高了，我做不到！！|#0101Bad05_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:唔……<br>我来把你们两个往上抛，怎么样？|#0101Bad05_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3,ArmL7
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:面对雪莉的提议，艾玛和汉娜都瞪圆了眼睛。|#0101Bad05_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:往上抛……|#0101Bad05_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你的想法也有够像猩猩的……|#0101Bad05_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:只不过，我想我是实在做不到<br>把你们直接抛出外面。|#0101Bad05_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR8,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我在想，把你们抛到爬墙的半路上，<br>剩下的距离靠你们自己来爬……怎么样。|#0101Bad05_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和汉娜对视了一下。<br>靠雪莉的怪力，或许真的可行。|#0101Bad05_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL7
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR8,ArmL4
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:可是，之后呢？雪莉你怎么办？|#0101Bad05_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR8,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:之后不用担心！<br>就这么点高度，我能自己爬。|#0101Bad05_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:给我等一下。<br>那你先出去，<br>再来喊人帮忙不是更好……|#0101Bad05_Hanna010| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR7,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:……哎呀，被发现了？|#0101Bad05_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR11,ArmL10

