[PrintTextModified Text:抓住壁面中段的汉娜<br>朝雪莉喊道。|#0101Bad05_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR11,ArmL10

