[PrintTextModified Text:被雪莉抛出的艾玛<br>尽力抓住了墙面。|#0101Bad05_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哈啊，哈啊……吓死人了……|#0101Bad05_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:好啦，爬上去吧！|#0101Bad05_Sherry014| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯、嗯……雪莉你也快点上来！|#0101Bad05_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到艾玛的话，雪莉摇了摇头。|#0101Bad05_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR19,ArmL14

[PrintTextModified Text:不用管我了，<br>我确实没办法爬上去了。|#0101Bad05_Sherry015| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哈！？你说什么啊！？<br>你刚才不是说自己能爬上来吗！|#0101Bad05_Hanna013| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊哈哈～对不起，我骗你们的。<br>其实……我已经不行了。|#0101Bad05_Sherry016| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉翻身露出了自己的侧腹。<br>有根粗大的树枝深深地刺进了里面。|#0101Bad05_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和汉娜倒抽一口凉气。雪莉朝她们笑了笑。|#0101Bad05_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR19,ArmL14

[PrintTextModified Text:好像是掉下来的时候被刺中了，<br>能感觉到它已经捅到内脏了。<br>所以呢，你们不用管我啦！|#0101Bad05_Sherry017| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:开……开什么玩笑啊！<br>我们怎么可能会丢下你不管！|#0101Bad05_Hanna014| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对啊！至少我们其中的一个<br>去找帮手来就好……！|#0101Bad05_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR18,ArmL14

[PrintTextModified Text:不，没关系的。<br>总感觉，到时候已经来不及了……<br>你们两个快去吧……|#0101Bad05_Sherry018| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉摇摇晃晃地倚靠在墙壁上。|#0101Bad05_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……不许你擅自放弃！<br>明明你平时就摆出一副打不死的样子！|#0101Bad05_Hanna015| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜的声音变得急促，开始伸手爬墙。|#0101Bad05_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜……！|#0101Bad05_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:快爬出这里吧！<br>要尽快找人过来帮忙……|#0101Bad05_Hanna016| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:之后我要狠狠笑话这个自以为是英雄的家伙！<br>在那里耍帅，结果还是要人救！|#0101Bad05_Hanna017| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……一定要救雪莉她出来！|#0101Bad05_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

