@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:我说得不对吗！？<br>要是我能更自由地飞在空中！<br>说不定我就能救到雪莉了！！|#0101Bad05_Hanna020| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:以前也是！！<br>如果我能更中用，<br>被丢下的那孩子也就不会死了！！|#0101Bad05_Hanna021| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（以前是怎么回事……汉娜她究竟怎么了……？）|#0101Bad05_Ema023| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

